                        "sense_id": "bf3e2515-0e85-36ad-8fa2-6ddd9d621984",
                        "entry_id": "d2d48399-c6b4-3b2b-add0-b022253d27fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Jewish"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "474ce0c3-838b-4be3-bb2a-859439116d3c",
                                "sense_id": "bf3e2515-0e85-36ad-8fa2-6ddd9d621984",
                                "text": "Tout ce que Paris compte de minets, pédés, zyvas, sapeurs, négros, bolosses, étudiants, bicots, bracass et beaux gosses se retrouve chez H&M pour enfiler les derniers molards de la mode, tout ce que le capital feuj cherche à leur fourguer de merdes fabriquées par des gosses à l'autre bout du monde — et ces connards payent pour porter ça.",
                                "translation": "All the pussies, queers, buffoons, dressed-up blacks, niggas, losers, students, wogs, good-for-nothings, and hotshots in Paris gather at H&M to put on the latest fashions, all the crap that capitalist Jews are trying to sell them made by kids on the other side of the world - and these assholes pay to wear it.",
                                "english": "All the pussies, queers, buffoons, dressed-up blacks, niggas, losers, students, wogs, good-for-nothings, and hotshots in Paris gather at H&M to put on the latest fashions, all the crap that capitalist Jews are trying to sell them made by kids on the other side of the world - and these assholes pay to wear it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
